小野妹子","cardTitle":"大洋を渡る・小野妹子","achievementText":"遣隋使として中国の隋に渡り、進んだ制度や文化を学んだ。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/005.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/005.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"006","originalEra":"飛鳥時代","gameStage":"ancient","gameStageLabel":"古代","drawGroup":"飛鳥","category":"政治・軍事","personName":"中臣鎌足","cardTitle":"影の立役者・中臣鎌足","achievementText":"大化の改新を支え、のちに栄えた藤原氏の祖となった。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/006.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/006.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"007","originalEra":"飛鳥時代","gameStage":"ancient","gameStageLabel":"古代","drawGroup":"飛鳥","category":"政治・軍事","personName":"中大兄皇子","cardTitle":"革命の覇者・中大兄皇子","achievementText":"大化の改新を進め、のちに天智天皇となった。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/007.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/007.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"008","originalEra":"奈良時代","gameStage":"ancient","gameStageLabel":"古代","drawGroup":"奈良","category":"政治・軍事","personName":"聖武天皇","cardTitle":"鎮護国家の祈り・聖武天皇","achievementText":"国分寺・国分尼寺を建て、東大寺の大仏を造らせた。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/008.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/008.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"009","originalEra":"平安時代","gameStage":"ancient","gameStageLabel":"古代","drawGroup":"平安","category":"政治・軍事","personName":"桓武天皇","cardTitle":"平安の夜明け・桓武天皇","achievementText":"都を平安京へ移し、新しい政治を始めた。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/009.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/009.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"010","originalEra":"平安時代","gameStage":"ancient","gameStageLabel":"古代","drawGroup":"平安","category":"政治・軍事","personName":"坂上田村麻呂","cardTitle":"蝦夷平定の武神・坂上田村麻呂","achievementText":"征夷大将軍となり、東北地方の蝦夷を征討した。","portraitImage":"/assets/historical-figures/portrait/010.webp","fullCardImage":"/assets/historical-figures/full/010.webp","active":true},{"cardNo":"011","originalEra":"平安時代","gameStage":"ancient","ga